        ":question/problem": "Let $u=\u27e84,3,2\u27e9$ and $v=\u27e86,1,7\u27e9.$ Find $u\\times v.$",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Using the determinant formula, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\times v & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 4 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 1 & 7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 7\\end{aligned}|i-|\\begin{aligned}4 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{aligned}|j+|\\begin{aligned}4 & 3 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}|k \\\\  & =((3)(7)-(2)(1))i-((4)(7)-(2)(6))j+((4)(1)-(3)(6))k \\\\  & =(21-(2))i-(28-(12))j+(4-(18))k \\\\  & =19i-16j-14k \\\\  & =\u27e819,-16,-14\u27e9.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
